# Local Spring Boot requests
### GET to message of the day
GET http://localhost:8080/messages/motd
### Get to quote
GET http://localhost:8080/messages/quote
### Get to alpha feature (might be disabled)
GET http://localhost:8080/alpha/awesomeResult
### Get to beta feature (might be disabled)
GET http://localhost:8080/beta/quiteStable


# Kubernetes (k3d) requests
### GET to message of the day
GET http://localhost:8090/messages/motd
### Get to quote
GET http://localhost:8090/messages/quote
### Get to alpha feature (might be disabled)
GET http://localhost:8090/alpha/awesomeResult
### Get to beta feature (might be disabled)
GET http://localhost:8090/beta/quiteStable
